This package is part of the Agent Commerce Trust project — an open
specification + reference implementation surface for the AP2 trust
layer in JavaScript / TypeScript. The canonical specification lives in
the AP2-Travel reference at https://github.com/agent-commerce-trust/ap2-travel
and the trust-layer SDK documentation set published alongside the
Agent Commerce Trust organisation.

Third-party software referenced (but not bundled or redistributed) by
this package:

  - WebCrypto API — implemented natively by Node.js (≥ 20) and modern
    browsers; not redistributed.
